            "review_title": "Review at 29 Eatery & Bar",
            "review_text": "Lizelle17\nCape Town12 contributions\n0\nExcellent\nJun 2022 • Friends\nWhat a delight to find this small, cosy restaurant! Although I need to say immediately that the prices are high for Vietnam, the ambience, service and food make it well worth your while. There are some lovely special touches like a HAPPY HOUR, complimentary appetisers and great Sangria. The food will appeal to the Western palate - a great addition in Thu Dau Mot. The chef is obviously internationally trained and I look forward to more delicious additions to the menu. This is the kind of place where you can comfortably take someone for a special celebration - or to impress a business guest! I wish this restaurant every success for the future!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 6, 2022\n29 Eatery & Bar\nThank you so much, glad to serve you… Have beautiful day!\nWritten August 15, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
